cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or data, please cite the paper below."
title: "METAMATCH-Sleep: NLP retrieval of domain-specific variables from cohort metadata"
abstract: >-
  Code and curated data for a semi-automatic method (METAMATCH) that retrieves
  variables about a given health topic from the metadata of many cohort studies,
  demonstrated on sleep across 20 Dementias Platform UK cohorts.
type: software
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/draperb7/metamatch-sleep"
keywords:
  - natural language processing
  - metadata harmonisation
  - cohort studies
  - sleep
  - UMLS
  - BERT
